SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for a gathering to set new intent
 ions and connect with the energy of the new moon.\nMeet the New Moon in ce
 remony through astrology\, Akashic soul journeying\, ritual & embodied int
 ention.\nApproaching the threshold of a new lunar cycle with intentionalit
 y is a powerful choice that becomes even more amplified when done in commu
 nity.\n\nThe New Moon offers a monthly portal to pause\, listen inward\, a
 nd consciously seed what you desire to cultivate in the cycle ahead. Gathe
 ring in ceremony creates the space to step outside the momentum of everyda
 y life and meet that threshold with presence\, allowing your intentions to
  be witnessed\, embodied\, and amplified within the collective.\n\nEach Ne
 w Moon also carries the unique energetic signature of the zodiac sign it m
 oves through\, offering different themes and invitations for your growth. 
 By working intentionally with the astrology of each lunation\, you can ali
 gn your intentions with the energies already available to you and receive 
 deeper clarity around what is ready to begin.\n\nEach month\, we gather at
  the Soul Sanctuary beneath the dark moon sky for an evening of astrology\
 , soul journeying\, ritual\, and embodied intention.\n\n**This month with 
 the Scorpio New Moon\, we invite you beneath the surface\, into the places
  where truth\, power\, intimacy\, and transformation reside.**\n\n**Togeth
 er\, we’ll work with Scorpio’s alchemical medicine to release what has
  run its course\, reclaim energy or power we’ve given away\, and plant i
 ntentions rooted in the deeper truth of who we are becoming.**\n\n**What t
 o Expect**\n\n* Guided drop-in meditation\n* Astrological teaching + trans
 mission\n* Guided Akashic soul journey\n* Reflection + intention setting\n
 * Ceremonial fire offerings\n* Closing embodiment + integration\n* Sacred 
 space for connection and community\n\nNo prior experience with astrology\,
  meditation\, or ceremonial practice is necessary. Simply come as you are.
 \n\n**About Your Facilitators**\nAlessandra Mary is a trained priestess\, 
 ceremonialist\, and Akashic guide devoted to creating spaces where the sac
 red becomes something you can experience\, embody\, and weave into everyda
 y life.\n\nJenn is a witch of the cosmos and astrologer who brings the lan
 guage of the stars down to earth\, illuminating the energetic patterns and
  possibilities available within each lunar cycle.\n\nTogether\, Alessandra
  and Jenn weave the mystical and the embodied\, the cosmic and the ceremon
 ial\, creating a space where you can not only understand the energy of the
  New Moon\, but more importantly\, experience it.\n\n**What to Bring**\nOu
 r ceremony will primarily take place outside on the grass around the fire\
 , with a large covered porch available as our rain plan. Please dress with
  the evening weather in mind.\n\n**Be sure to bring:**\n\n* Water bottle\n
 * Journal + pen\n* Comfortable clothing and layers appropriate for the wea
 ther\n* Any sacred objects\, crystals\, talismans\, or other items you wou
 ld like to place on our collective altar and charge during the ceremony\n\
 nLawn blankets and meditation cushions will be provided\, though you are v
 ery welcome to bring your own blanket\, cushion\, or camping chair if you
 ’d prefer.\n\nCome ready to slow down\, listen deeply\, sit beneath the 
 dark moon\, and lean into what is waiting to begin.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: Pre-
 registration is required for this event to honor the capacity of the space
 .** If you would like to skip the fees\, you can Venmo us $30 [here](https
 ://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary "https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary"):
