SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n### November New Moon Ceremony\n\n### The
  Wisdom of the Soul\n\n**A Virtual Journey into the Akashic Records**\n\nW
 hat if you could access a deeper understanding of your soul's journey\, th
 e lessons you are learning\, and the possibilities waiting to unfold?\nJoi
 n us for a sacred New Moon gathering as we explore **The Wisdom of the Sou
 l** through a guided journey into the Akashic Records.\nIn many spiritual 
 traditions\, the Akashic Records are described as an energetic library con
 taining the experiences\, wisdom\, and possibilities of the soul. Whether 
 you understand them spiritually or symbolically\, this journey offers an o
 pportunity for personal reflection\, discovery\, and greater self-awarenes
 s.\nDuring our gathering\, we will explore three questions:\n\n* **What le
 sson is my soul asking me to understand at this time?**\n* **What pattern 
 or belief am I ready to move beyond?**\n* **What wisdom can help guide my 
 next chapter?**\n\nOur evening will include guided meditation\, an Akashic
  Records journey\, personal reflection\, intention setting\, and an opport
 unity for community sharing.\n\n**No previous experience is necessary.** S
 imply find a quiet\, comfortable place\, bring an open mind and heart\, an
 d allow yourself to explore whatever wisdom may emerge.\nOur guiding thoug
 ht for the evening:\n*“We do not enter the Akashic Records to escape the
  life we are living. We enter to better understand the life we are here to
  live.”*\n\nI look forward to sharing this sacred journey with you.\n**S
 haman Phil**\n\n-Shaman Phil
