SUMMARY:Try it out night at Spirited Improv
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nWhether you've never set foot in a Spirit
 ed Improv circle or you've been coming home to us for years\, I want to le
 t you know about something new. A single playshop\, just two hours\, where
  you can feel the magic for yourself or simply enjoy it again with fresh e
 yes.\n\nWhat if one day could remind you what it feels like to be fully hu
 man\, together?\n\n**What is Spirited Improv "Try it out" Playshop?**\nA 2
 -hour playshop of movement\, music\, story\, and unscripted connection. No
  script\, no performance pressure\, no experience needed. Just a circle of
  people willing to show up\, play\, and see what unfolds when a room lets 
 go of the need to get it right.\n\n**When?**\nNov 11\, 5:30 - 7:30 pm in S
 wannanoa\n\n**Who it's for**\nPeople craving real connection\, creative ex
 pression\, and a little more Love in their lives. If you're drawn to perso
 nal growth\, spiritual community\, or simply want an evening that feels di
 fferent from the ones that came before it\, this is for you.\n\n**Led by**
 \nJessica Chilton\, an expressive arts practitioner and TEDx performer wit
 h twenty years in improvisational performing arts. She holds space with wa
 rmth and a deep trust in whatever wants to emerge in the room.\n\n**What p
 eople are saying**\n"It's like free-falling into the unknown\, but with a 
 big\, warm\, and fluffy safety net that hugs you when you land."\n"We're j
 ust taking off all our stuff and walking out in our essence."\nCome see fo
 r yourself.\n\nRegister at [https://www.spiritedimprov.com/offers/6yz8AC3z
 /checkout](https://www.spiritedimprov.com/offers/6yz8AC3z/checkout)
